  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/02/IMG_7355.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Teatro M&oacute;naco ha acogido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado el concierto de los enamorados de la Onda&nbsp; Big Band, en el que han interpretado temas rom&aacute;nticos, la mayor&iacute;a boleros. Algunos de ellos los han cantado B&aacute;rbara Breva, Diego Picazo o Nuria Pallar&eacute;s.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7290.jpg\" alt=\"img_7290\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7291.jpg\" alt=\"img_7291\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7292.jpg\" alt=\"img_7292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7293.jpg\" alt=\"img_7293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7295.jpg\" alt=\"img_7295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7296.jpg\" alt=\"img_7296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7297.jpg\" alt=\"img_7297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7298.jpg\" alt=\"img_7298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bigbandconcertenamorats/img_7299.jpg\" alt=\"img_7299\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://